<article class="env-lemma" id="0D97">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0D97">Lemma <span data-tag="0D97">85.5.3</span>.</a> With notation and hypotheses as in Lemma <a href="/tag/0D96" data-tag="0D96">85.5.2</a>. For $K \in D(\mathcal{C}_{total})$ we have $(g'_ n)^{-1}Rh_{total, *}K = Rh_{n, *}g_ n^{-1}K$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Let $\mathcal{I}^\bullet $ be a K-injective complex on $\mathcal{C}_{total}$ representing $K$. Then $g_ n^{-1}K$ is represented by $g_ n^{-1}\mathcal{I}^\bullet = \mathcal{I}_ n^\bullet $ which is K-injective by Lemma <a href="/tag/09WH" data-tag="09WH">85.3.6</a>. We have $(g'_ n)^{-1}h_{total, *}\mathcal{I}^\bullet = h_{n, *}g_ n^{-1}\mathcal{I}_ n^\bullet $ by Lemma <a href="/tag/0D96" data-tag="0D96">85.5.2</a> which gives the desired equality. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>